     A            SB5           40A  O  9 33COLOR(GRN)
     A                                 10  3'Phone book entries'
     A            SC6            7A  O 10 24
     A            SB6           40A  O 10 33COLOR(GRN)
     A                                 11  3'Appointments'
     A            SC7            7A  O 11 24
